sequenceDiagram
    participant Worker
    participant ControlPlane
    participant HintCatalog
    participant Queue

    Worker->>ControlPlane: Fetch hints
    Worker->>ControlPlane: Stream logs and record failure event
    ControlPlane->>HintCatalog: Store failure context
    Worker->>Worker: Classify reason and match hints
    Worker->>ControlPlane: Save auto hint when new pattern
    Worker->>ControlPlane: Record decision trace metadata
    Worker->>Queue: Enqueue retry with recipes
    Queue-->>Worker: Next retry job
    Worker->>ControlPlane: Record final outcome and hint usage
